EN:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Whoa, a flea!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Please tell me that
didn't come from me!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Aw, dude!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I-I swear I've been taking
baths and everything!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Qué movida, una pulga!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡¿La tenía yo?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Será posible!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} No lo entiendo, ¡si
me ducho una vez a la semana!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Vay, pire!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sakın benden çıktığını söyleme!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Of be!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Y-yemin ederim banyo yapıyorum, hem de
her şeyimi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
